; Part of millgui. MIT licence, see millgui/LICENSE.
; Preconditions for every probing macro: o<millgui_probe_ready> call
; [allow rotation]. The argument is optional (0 when left out); only an
; edge-angle run that will rewrite the work rotation passes 1. Checks,
; without moving or changing any state, that the probe tool #3014 is in the
; spindle and has a diameter in the tool table, that the probe settings it
; relies on are usable (slow feed #3015 >= 0; fast feed #3016, traverse
; #3017, XY reach #3018, XY clearance #3019, Z reach #3020 and Z clearance
; #3021 > 0; extra depth #3022 >= 0), and that the coordinates are ready
; (o<millgui_coords_ready>: G40, machine units, no G52/G92, no rotation),
; and that G43 is in effect with the probe's own tool table length.
; It aborts with a plain message otherwise.
o<millgui_probe_ready> sub
#<allow_rotation> = #1
o100 if [#3014 LE 0]
    (ABORT, Set the probe tool number in the probe settings first)
o100 endif
o110 if [#5400 NE #3014]
    (ABORT, Load the probe tool before probing: it is not the tool in the spindle)
o110 endif
o120 if [#5410 LE 0]
    (ABORT, The probe tool has no tip diameter in the tool table)
o120 endif
o130 if [#3015 LT 0]
    (ABORT, Probe slow feed must not be negative)
o130 endif
o131 if [[#3016 LE 0] OR [#3017 LE 0]]
    (ABORT, Probe fast and traverse feeds must be positive)
o131 endif
o132 if [[#3018 LE 0] OR [#3019 LE 0]]
    (ABORT, Probe XY search distance and XY clearance must be positive)
o132 endif
o133 if [[#3020 LE 0] OR [#3021 LE 0]]
    (ABORT, Probe Z search distance and Z clearance must be positive)
o133 endif
o134 if [#3022 LT 0]
    (ABORT, Extra probe depth must not be negative)
o134 endif
o<millgui_coords_ready> call [#<allow_rotation>]
; Z results are the tip by the tool length offset: it must be the probe's
; own (G43 with the table length). Applied offset = machine Z - program Z
; - work offset Z (G52/G92 are zero, checked above).
o140 if [#<_tool_offset> EQ 0]
    (ABORT, Apply the probe's tool length offset with G43 before probing)
o140 endif
o141 if [ABS[#<_abs_z> - #5422 - #[5203 + 20 * #5220] - #5403] GT 0.0001]
    (ABORT, The active tool length offset is not the probe's: apply G43 for the probe tool)
o141 endif
o<millgui_probe_ready> endsub
M2
